<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Swire call warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Swire call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has issued 90 million American-style call warrants on shares of Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot;.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$64	    PREMIUM	    15.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.988	 GEARING	    6.5X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.FEB.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     13.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$64	    MIN EXER LOT     5,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
